{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手黃淑蔓（Feanna）今日現身旺角鬧市出席活動，穿短裙仔打扮十分清爽，她覺得今日行文青風。</p><p>透露距離聖誕仲有一段日子，只希望聖誕有工開，可以同粉絲及在音樂中過聖誕好幸福，好多年聖誕都是工作中渡過。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.029624+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:59:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033088+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033088+00:00","content_hash":"cc8999ba4ba89840773eea14b5a18563ec3de63c64ccbcf559492fdc6d45b235","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}